  "music": {
    "_concept": "SIMPLE RULES, ENDLESS MUSIC. Every melody here is generated by a real rule written in the spec: (1) TOE: 'görelilik' (slow pad/bass, half notes) and 'kuantum' (jittery triplet arp) play in two rhythms that refuse to line up, then lock into one unison chord on 'tek bir denklem'. (2) Hawking 1980 = bright major cadence; 2002 = the SAME cadence goes deceptive (V→vi) and hangs unresolved: 'belki son teori yok'. (3) Laplace callback: the fm clock-bell of the gelecek-secim reel, now a DUET of two logistic-map melodies (r=3.9) whose seeds differ by 0.0001 — identical for 12 notes (6 beats), then audibly apart = chaos. (4) Chess: an elementary cellular automaton, Wolfram's Rule 30 on 8 cells (= 8 files of the board), one generation per beat → the lead. Rule known, tune unpredictable. Chess-clock tick-tock drums. (5) Drop: Rule 30 widened + all voices, sonic logo. (6) Einstein: near silence, pad maj7 shimmer. (7) Hayret: warm groove returns in brand timbre, sonic logo on the seam.",
